#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.6.7.rst:4
msgid "v2.6.7"
msgstr "v2.6.7"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.6.7.rst:6
msgid ""
"v2.6.7 moves the DFU firmware-flashing and video-conversion workflows into "
"embedded IDE terminal dialogs, adds CYW4343 WiFi co-processor programming "
"for the Arduino Portenta H7, and improves grayscale-sensor handling and the "
"DFU-mode prompt. The IDE remains on Qt Creator 4.0.2, the bundled OpenMV "
"firmware advances to 3.6.9, and there are no breaking changes."
msgstr ""
"v2.6.7 memindahkan alur kerja flashing firmware DFU dan konversi video ke "
"dalam dialog terminal IDE yang tertanam, menambahkan pemrograman ko-prosesor"
" WiFi CYW4343 untuk Arduino Portenta H7, serta meningkatkan penanganan "
"sensor skala abu-abu dan prompt mode DFU. IDE tetap menggunakan Qt Creator "
"4.0.2, firmware OpenMV bawaan meningkat ke 3.6.9, dan tidak ada perubahan "
"yang merusak."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.6.7.rst:15
msgid "On this page"
msgstr "Di halaman ini"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.6.7.rst:18
msgid "Highlights"
msgstr "Sorotan"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.6.7.rst:20
msgid ""
"**Embedded DFU flashing terminal** runs ``dfu-util`` inside a resizable IDE "
"dialog with live output (errors highlighted in red) and a Cancel button "
"instead of an external OS terminal window."
msgstr ""
"**Terminal flashing DFU tertanam** menjalankan ``dfu-util`` di dalam dialog "
"IDE yang dapat diubah ukurannya dengan output langsung (kesalahan disorot "
"merah) dan tombol Cancel alih-alih jendela terminal OS eksternal."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.6.7.rst:23
msgid ""
"**CYW4343 WiFi firmware** is now programmed alongside the main firmware when"
" flashing the Arduino Portenta H7 over DFU."
msgstr ""
"**Firmware WiFi CYW4343** kini diprogram bersama firmware utama saat mem-"
"flash Arduino Portenta H7 melalui DFU."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.6.7.rst:25
msgid ""
"**Embedded video-conversion terminal** runs the FFmpeg ``Convert Video`` "
"tool in the same resizable IDE dialog with live output and Cancel."
msgstr ""
"**Terminal konversi video tertanam** menjalankan alat FFmpeg ``Convert "
"Video`` di dialog IDE yang dapat diubah ukurannya dengan output langsung dan"
" Cancel."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.6.7.rst:27
msgid ""
"**Redesigned DFU-mode prompt** uses a firmware-version drop-down and an "
"optional ``Erase internal file system`` checkbox that remembers your last "
"choice."
msgstr ""
"**Prompt mode DFU yang didesain ulang** menggunakan drop-down versi firmware"
" dan kotak centang ``Erase internal file system`` opsional yang mengingat "
"pilihan terakhir Anda."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.6.7.rst:30
msgid ""
"**Grayscale sensor support** extends automatic ``RGB565`` to ``GRAYSCALE`` "
"rewriting to the **MT9V034** in addition to the **HM01B0**."
msgstr ""
"**Dukungan sensor skala abu-abu** memperluas penulisan ulang otomatis "
"``RGB565`` ke ``GRAYSCALE`` ke **MT9V034** selain **HM01B0**\\ ."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.6.7.rst:34
msgid "New features"
msgstr "Fitur baru"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.6.7.rst:36
msgid ""
"**Embedded DFU flashing terminal.** ``dfu-util`` now launches directly into "
"a ``QDialog`` terminal that streams live ``stdout`` as plain text and "
"highlights ``stderr`` in red, with a Cancel button and saved window "
"geometry, replacing the external OS terminal window. (`c2875d871 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/c2875d871>`__)"
msgstr ""
"**Terminal flashing DFU tertanam.** ``dfu-util`` kini diluncurkan langsung "
"ke terminal ``QDialog`` yang mengalirkan ``stdout`` langsung sebagai teks "
"biasa dan menyorot ``stderr`` dalam merah, dengan tombol Cancel dan geometri"
" jendela tersimpan, menggantikan jendela terminal OS eksternal. (\\ "
"`c2875d871 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/c2875d871>`__\\ )"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.6.7.rst:41
msgid ""
"**CYW4343 WiFi co-processor programming.** Loading firmware via DFU on the "
"Arduino Portenta H7 now runs an extra programming step that flashes the "
"onboard CYW4343 WiFi firmware (``CYW4343/cyw4343.bin`` at ``0x90F00000``), "
"driven by ``extraProgramCommands`` in ``dfu.txt``. (`62e0ba771 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/62e0ba771>`__, `ba31998ce "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/ba31998ce>`__)"
msgstr ""
"**Pemrograman ko-prosesor WiFi CYW4343.** Memuat firmware melalui DFU di "
"Arduino Portenta H7 kini menjalankan langkah pemrograman tambahan yang mem-"
"flash firmware WiFi CYW4343 onboard (\\ ``CYW4343/cyw4343.bin`` di "
"``0x90F00000``\\ ), dikendalikan oleh ``extraProgramCommands`` di "
"``dfu.txt``\\ . (\\ `62e0ba771 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/62e0ba771>`__\\ , `ba31998ce <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/ba31998ce>`__\\ )"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.6.7.rst:47
msgid ""
"**Embedded video-conversion terminal.** The FFmpeg-based ``Convert Video`` "
"tool now runs ``ffmpeg`` in a resizable IDE terminal dialog with live output"
" and Cancel rather than launching an external terminal. (`5987bb152 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/5987bb152>`__)"
msgstr ""
"**Terminal konversi video tertanam.** Alat ``Convert Video`` berbasis FFmpeg"
" kini menjalankan ``ffmpeg`` di dialog terminal IDE yang dapat diubah "
"ukurannya dengan output langsung dan Cancel, bukan meluncurkan terminal "
"eksternal. (\\ `5987bb152 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/5987bb152>`__\\ )"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.6.7.rst:51
msgid ""
"**Factory provisioning option.** A hidden ``-form_key`` command-line option,"
" when supplied, auto-registers a connected OpenMV Cam's board/ID with "
"OpenMV's server instead of showing the manual registration prompt. "
"(`d5740f71e <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/d5740f71e>`__)"
msgstr ""
"**Opsi provisioning pabrik.** Opsi baris perintah tersembunyi "
"``-form_key``\\ , bila diberikan, secara otomatis mendaftarkan papan/ID "
"OpenMV Cam yang terhubung ke server OpenMV, bukan menampilkan prompt "
"pendaftaran manual. (\\ `d5740f71e <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/d5740f71e>`__\\ )"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.6.7.rst:57
msgid "Other changes and improvements"
msgstr "Perubahan dan peningkatan lainnya"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.6.7.rst:59
msgid ""
"**Redesigned DFU-mode prompt.** The ``board detected in DFU mode`` prompt is"
" now a dialog with a drop-down showing the exact latest release firmware "
"version plus an optional ``Erase internal file system`` checkbox, and it "
"remembers the last selected action and erase state. (`0a4d6258c "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/0a4d6258c>`__)"
msgstr ""
"**Prompt mode DFU yang didesain ulang.** Prompt ``board detected in DFU "
"mode`` kini berupa dialog dengan drop-down yang menampilkan versi firmware "
"rilis terbaru beserta kotak centang ``Erase internal file system`` opsional,"
" dan mengingat tindakan terakhir yang dipilih serta status erase. (\\ "
"`0a4d6258c <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/0a4d6258c>`__\\ )"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.6.7.rst:64
msgid ""
"**Erase-checkbox tooltips.** The bootloader/DFU erase-filesystem checkboxes "
"now have tooltips clarifying that erasing the internal flash drive does not "
"erase a removable SD card. (`0a4d6258c <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/0a4d6258c>`__)"
msgstr ""
"**Tooltip kotak centang erase.** Kotak centang erase-filesystem pada "
"bootloader/DFU kini memiliki tooltip yang mengklarifikasi bahwa menghapus "
"drive flash internal tidak menghapus kartu SD yang dapat dilepas. (\\ "
"`0a4d6258c <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/0a4d6258c>`__\\ )"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.6.7.rst:68
msgid ""
"**In-place grayscale rewrite for open examples.** When an already-open "
"helloworld example is run on an HM01B0 or MT9V034 sensor, the IDE rewrites "
"it in place to use ``GRAYSCALE`` so it works on those grayscale-only "
"sensors. (`4448edb38 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/4448edb38>`__)"
msgstr ""
"**Penulisan ulang skala abu-abu di tempat untuk contoh terbuka.** Saat "
"contoh helloworld yang sudah terbuka dijalankan pada sensor HM01B0 atau "
"MT9V034, IDE menulisnya ulang di tempat untuk menggunakan ``GRAYSCALE`` agar"
" berfungsi pada sensor hanya skala abu-abu tersebut. (\\ `4448edb38 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/4448edb38>`__\\ )"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.6.7.rst:72
msgid ""
"**Clearer post-flash message.** After a DFU/firmware update, the "
"confirmation message now explains the case where ``main.py`` was overwritten"
" without erasing the disk, so the camera simply runs ``main.py`` and mounts "
"its drive. (`62e0ba771 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/62e0ba771>`__)"
msgstr ""
"**Pesan pasca-flash yang lebih jelas.** Setelah pembaruan DFU/firmware, "
"pesan konfirmasi kini menjelaskan kasus di mana ``main.py`` ditimpa tanpa "
"menghapus disk, sehingga kamera cukup menjalankan ``main.py`` dan me-mount "
"drive-nya. (\\ `62e0ba771 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/62e0ba771>`__\\ )"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.6.7.rst:76
msgid ""
"**Updated example scripts.** ``ulab.py`` now uses ``ulab.numerical`` for "
"mean/std, ``deep_sleep.py`` reorders the sensor soft-sleep before the OV7725"
" regulator bypass, and a new ``19-Low-Power/extint_wakeup.py`` demonstrates "
"waking from stop mode via an external interrupt. (`c30fcb7c3 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/c30fcb7c3>`__)"
msgstr ""
"**Skrip contoh yang diperbarui.** ``ulab.py`` kini menggunakan "
"``ulab.numerical`` untuk mean/std, ``deep_sleep.py`` mengurutkan ulang "
"sensor soft-sleep sebelum bypass regulator OV7725, dan ``19-Low-"
"Power/extint_wakeup.py`` baru mendemonstrasikan bangun dari stop mode "
"melalui interupsi eksternal. (\\ `c30fcb7c3 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/c30fcb7c3>`__\\ )"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.6.7.rst:81
msgid ""
"**Connect dialog polish.** The ``Connecting...`` progress text was "
"reformatted with line breaks for readability. (`0d3619245 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/0d3619245>`__)"
msgstr ""
"**Penyempurnaan dialog Connect.** Teks progres ``Connecting...`` diformat "
"ulang dengan jeda baris untuk keterbacaan. (\\ `0d3619245 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/0d3619245>`__\\ )"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.6.7.rst:86
msgid "Bug fixes"
msgstr "Perbaikan bug"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.6.7.rst:88
msgid ""
"Fixed all Save-As dialogs (save image, template, descriptor, keypoints, "
"network model, dataset export, terminal log, save video, convert video "
"output) to reject filenames with no extension and prompt the user to add one"
" instead of saving an extension-less file. (`3a3ba3c5e "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/3a3ba3c5e>`__)"
msgstr ""
"Memperbaiki semua dialog Save-As (simpan citra, template, deskriptor, titik "
"kunci, model jaringan, ekspor dataset, log terminal, simpan video, konversi "
"output video) agar menolak nama file tanpa ekstensi dan meminta pengguna "
"untuk menambahkannya, bukan menyimpan file tanpa ekstensi. (\\ `3a3ba3c5e "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/3a3ba3c5e>`__\\ )"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.6.7.rst:93
msgid ""
"Fixed macOS-specific UI rendering: the menu text/button color inversion "
"(which keyed off the menu background brightness) and the custom dark "
"scrollbar styling are no longer applied on macOS. (`39179b6cb "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/39179b6cb>`__, `8b11fbcab "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/8b11fbcab>`__)"
msgstr ""
"Memperbaiki rendering UI khusus macOS: inversi warna teks/tombol menu (yang "
"didasarkan pada kecerahan latar belakang menu) dan penataan gaya scrollbar "
"gelap khusus tidak lagi diterapkan di macOS. (\\ `39179b6cb "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/39179b6cb>`__\\ , `8b11fbcab "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/8b11fbcab>`__\\ )"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.6.7.rst:100
msgid "Platform and tool support"
msgstr "Dukungan platform dan alat"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.6.7.rst:102
msgid "**Qt Creator base:** 4.0.2."
msgstr "**Basis Qt Creator:** 4.0.2."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.6.7.rst:103
msgid "**Bundled OpenMV firmware:** 3.6.8 to 3.6.9."
msgstr "**Firmware OpenMV bawaan:** 3.6.8 ke 3.6.9."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.6.7.rst:104
msgid ""
"**CYW4343 WiFi firmware:** new ``CYW4343/cyw4343.bin`` blob bundled for the "
"Arduino Portenta H7."
msgstr ""
"**Firmware WiFi CYW4343:** blob ``CYW4343/cyw4343.bin`` baru disertakan "
"untuk Arduino Portenta H7."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.6.7.rst:106
msgid ""
"**Grayscale sensor scripts:** New File, example, and dataset scripts now "
"switch ``RGB565`` to ``GRAYSCALE`` on the MT9V034 in addition to the HM01B0 "
"(VGA to QVGA only for the HM01B0). (`ef0c22efb "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/ef0c22efb>`__, `d5bdd8890 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/d5bdd8890>`__)"
msgstr ""
"**Skrip sensor skala abu-abu:** skrip New File, contoh, dan dataset kini "
"beralih dari ``RGB565`` ke ``GRAYSCALE`` pada MT9V034 selain HM01B0 (hanya "
"VGA ke QVGA untuk HM01B0). (\\ `ef0c22efb <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/ef0c22efb>`__\\ , `d5bdd8890 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/d5bdd8890>`__\\ )"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.6.7.rst:113
msgid "Breaking changes"
msgstr "Perubahan yang merusak"

